flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Choose input CSV]
    B --> C[CsvReader parses headers and rows]
    C --> D{Rows and schema valid?}
    D -- No --> X[Show error and stop]
    D -- Yes --> E[AnalyticsReport validates values]
    E --> F[Aggregate visits, page views, source and date]
    F --> G{Search fields present?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Aggregate impressions and clicks; compute CTR]
    G -- No --> I[Skip search calculations]
    H --> J[Rank results and make simple recommendations]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Print console report]
    K --> L([End])